Industry: Luxury Travel | Airport Concierge | Protocol & Meet-and-Assist Services



Business Description:

Altitude Concierge Services provides premium airport protocol, VIP meet-and-assist, concierge, and executive travel support services across Kenya, Ghana, and Nigeria. We deliver seamless arrival, departure, transit, and ground coordination experiences for business executives, diplomats, premium travellers, families, event guests, and international visitors.



